wn":{"text":"Trepent references having been made to Mefo? Cantor Voo by Parties in the Mofussul, to know the terms on which they conduct agency Business, it has occurred to them that this information cannot be better conveyed than by a Circular, explaining shortly the rates of commis. soon, as well as the general plan they pursue, in the management of their Constituents affairs\n\nWith this view, the following statement has been prepared: I\n\nTo prevent as far as possible any misapprehension on the part of Constituents\n\nwhose attention may not have been directed to the subject. Mefs Lanto\n\nTo take the present opportunity to enclose it to all their correspondents.\n\nCommission on executing orders for Goods Vca _____ 5 per cent\n\non guarantee bills, and on becoming security\n\nfor Administration of Estate ___ 2/2 \"On Executionship ___ 5.\n\nOn management of estate for Executors __ 2/2\n\non effecting insurance on lives and property __/2.\n\nOn purchasing or negotiating Bills of\n\nExchange _____1.\n\nOn returned Bulls\n\nOn Collecting House Rent ___2½.\n\nOn granting letters of credit ___1\n\nOn sale & purchase of Government Securities Transfer\n\nOn the amount debited or credited in Account","images":{}},"outputImages":{"layout_det_res":"https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//479bef8f-e014-4eb1-ac16-5bfd675878b1/layout_det_res_1.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-31T10%3A10%3A44Z%2F-1%2F%2F7e85de7bda370d6b3e5db8a7ffdf11d1cebf3e5328cb9ff4a5422453444e5edc"},"inputImage":"https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//479bef8f-e014-4eb1-ac16-5bfd675878b1/input_img_1.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-31T10%3A10%3A44Z%2F-1%2F%2F3f143624b224b60bda85957dedd0ab34029b4d7cc2a972392ddc4fb1b5f2bfad"},{"prunedResult":{"model_settings":{"use_doc_preprocessor":true,"use_layout_detection":true,"use_chart_recognition":true,"use